akfast\", \"Kiko never eats bread\". Thứ tự: always > usually > sometimes > never.\nThứ trong tuần luôn viết hoa: Monday, Sunday.","lessonId":"u5n6l1","lessonVersion":"v2.u5n6l1","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u5n6","order":37,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u5n6l1","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec1","signature":"sz2fC2XaKQimOf-RgZqo1FSEghQ8hGa1MxKwVbW3odhoXYP9tLONpyA1oi2gh9eWf-guMbyUe3vye-6a4YLVDw","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u5.vocab","u5.grammar","listening"],"title":"Luôn luôn, thỉnh thoảng · Bài 1","unitId":"u5"}